    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/8882e707b52585af33e6a56db90ac9c8.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/d30aa19164a52c01369d5f3a04b4a89c.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/d30aa19164a52c01369d5f3a04b4a89c.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/d30aa19164a52c01369d5f3a04b4a89c.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this berry filled brawler together with your friends, punch them, throw them or even headbutt them out of the map, and be the sole survivor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/1b53d916d6da83b39ce2150d33740c42.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/2777165b857f4bb117d9767c240c21ce.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/2777165b857f4bb117d9767c240c21ce.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/2777165b857f4bb117d9767c240c21ce.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dont have that many friends? no worries! you can just as well fight totally random strangers! in multiple environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/ea64e3b1c1734a84a183473dd5148df2.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph into extreme variants of BOB, everything from Fire, Ice, Muscles and many more!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/8ba6ddcf8b27a0774ebbd587d04912fd.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093ec1a871aaa2.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093ec1a871aaa2.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093ec1a871aaa2.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May nothing stand in the way of you becoming the next BOB berry king! Not even legday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/2a32ceeba80d2f3c46bfd863acd63e3f.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3cfcad28f951b435db99b56841e40130.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3cfcad28f951b435db99b56841e40130.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3cfcad28f951b435db99b56841e40130.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
