class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dont have that many friends? no worries! you can just as well fight totally random strangers! in multiple environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/ea64e3b1c1734a84a183473dd5148df2.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/825039c82054686a25a85c4f31692939.mp4?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph into extreme variants of BOB, everything from Fire, Ice, Muscles and many more!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/8ba6ddcf8b27a0774ebbd587d04912fd.avif?t=1748851229\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093ec1a871aaa2.poster.avif?t=1748851229\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093ec1a871aaa2.webm?t=1748851229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697780/extras/3c63f2b20596999c77093